msgstr "沒有作用中的 dnf5daemon 工作階段"

#: src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1257
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server session was reset while resolving the transaction. The"
" prepared package changes were lost; please try again."
msgstr "解析事務時 dnf5daemon-server 工作階段已重設。已準備好的軟體包變更已遺失，請重試。"

#: src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1289
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server did not return a valid transaction summary. Please try"
" again."
msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 未傳回有效的事務摘要，請重試。"

#: src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1298
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server returned a malformed transaction summary. Please try "
"again."
msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 傳回了格式錯誤的事務摘要，請重試。"

#: src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1314
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server returned a transaction summary in an unexpected "
"format. Please try again."
msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 傳回了格式非預期的事務摘要，請重試。"

#: src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1447
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server session was reset while running the transaction. The "
"resolved transaction was lost; please try again."
msgstr "執行事務時 dnf5daemon-server 工作階段已重設。已解析的事務已遺失，請重試。"

#: src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1496
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server did not confirm the transaction. Please try again."
msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 未確認該事務，請重試。"

